## Interface: 16001
## Title: Patchwerk Forever: Wayfarer
## Notes: Finds the way to your map pin, a quest you track or your RestedXP guide's next step: over the ground, through tunnels and over bridges, by flight path. Also remembers herb and ore spots and puts a sparkle on the things you can use. Type /wayfarer.
